 "remarks": "83 Washington Street, Unit 2-H - SoNo  Live in the heart of SoNo.  Step outside your door and into one of South Norwalk's most vibrant neighborhoods. 83 Washington Street, Unit 2-H puts restaurants, cafes, nightlife, shopping, the waterfront and the train station all within easy reach.  This distinctive loft-style residence offers the character and energy that make downtown SoNo living so desirable. An open layout creates a comfortable, contemporary space for relaxing, entertaining or working from home.  And in downtown SoNo, this is a major plus: one garage parking space is included in the rent.  At $2,400 per month, this is more than an apartment-it's a chance to enjoy the convenience, character and walkable lifestyle of Washington Street.  Highlights:  $2,400/month Loft-style residence One garage parking space included Prime Washington Street location Walk to restaurants, bars, cafes and entertainment Convenient to the South Norwalk train station Easy access to the waterfront and everything SoNo has to offer  Park the car. Drop the keys. Walk to dinner. Welcome to SoNo.",
